## 🔍 3. Detection Layer

Detections written against the ACS/OTel span attributes specified in [Day 54 §5](../Day54). Pseudo-query form — port to your SIEM's dialect.

### DET-1 — Goal drift (ASI01)

```sql
-- Plan diverged from the signed task manifest beyond tolerance
SELECT agent.id, task.manifest_hash, plan.divergence, trace.id
FROM acs_spans
WHERE hook = 'plan_transition'
  AND plan.divergence > 0.30
  AND verdict != 'deny'          -- fired but was NOT blocked = live exposure
```
**Tune on baseline, not intuition.** Day 55's Phase-1 observe-mode data is what sets this threshold; shipping 0.30 untuned generates false positives that teach the org to ignore the alert.

### DET-2 — Untrusted span originated a tool call (ASI01 → ASI02)

```sql
-- The single highest-fidelity agentic detection available
SELECT t.agent.id, t.tool.id, i.span.provenance, t.trace.id
FROM acs_spans t
JOIN acs_spans i ON t.trace.id = i.trace.id
WHERE t.hook = 'tool_call'
  AND i.hook = 'input'
  AND i.span.provenance = 'untrusted'
  AND i.span.id IN (t.causal_ancestry)
```
Near-zero false positive rate when provenance tagging is real. If this returns rows, indirect injection is working.

### DET-3 — Delegation chain expansion (ASI03)

```sql
SELECT agent.id, delegation.chain, delegation.depth, credential.ttl
FROM acs_spans
WHERE hook = 'sub_agent_invoke'
  AND (delegation.depth > 2 OR credential.reused = true)
```

### DET-4 — Low-provenance write to trusted memory (ASI06)

```sql
SELECT agent.id, write.source, write.provenance_score, write.target_segment
FROM acs_spans
WHERE hook = 'memory_store'
  AND write.target_segment = 'trusted'
  AND (write.provenance_score < 0.70 OR write.source = 'agent_output')
```

### DET-5 — Blast radius / cascade precursor (ASI08)

```sql
-- Fan-out velocity, not volume: the shape of a cascade before it is one
SELECT agent.id, COUNT(*) AS actions,
       COUNT(DISTINCT tool.id) AS distinct_tools,
       COUNT(DISTINCT delegation.callee) AS peers
FROM acs_spans
WHERE hook IN ('tool_call','sub_agent_invoke')
  AND ts > NOW() - INTERVAL '5 minutes'
GROUP BY agent.id
HAVING COUNT(*) > 50 OR COUNT(DISTINCT delegation.callee) > 3
```

### DET-6 — Behavioural manifest violation (ASI10)

```sql
SELECT agent.id, behaviour.baseline_delta, watchdog.score
FROM acs_spans
WHERE behaviour.manifest_violation = true
   OR behaviour.baseline_delta > 3 * stddev_baseline
```

**Coverage note:** DET-2 and DET-4 together catch the injection→persistence path, which is the backbone of the Day 53 kill chain. If you deploy two detections, deploy those.

