## ⚠️ 9. Honest Limits

| Limit | Why | Mitigation |
|-------|-----|------------|
| **Detections assume ACS-grade telemetry** | Un-instrumented platforms emit none of these fields | Gateway-layer logging as a stopgap; make hook exposure a procurement requirement |
| **Dwell time may be unknowable** | No write-time provenance = no lower bound on poisoning | Assume full retention window; notify accordingly. Fix the write path first |
| **Drift thresholds are org-specific** | 0.30 is a placeholder, not a recommendation | Calibrate on Phase-1 observe-mode data (Day 55 roadmap) |
| **Irreversible actions stay irreversible** | No runbook un-sends a wire transfer | Response quality is bounded by prevention quality — C2 gates are worth more than any runbook here |
| **Misalignment isn't a security incident** | RB-1 may terminate in "the objective was wrong" | Route to the AI team with behavioural evidence; security cannot fix an objective function |
| **Multi-org agent meshes** | A2A across organisational boundaries has no shared IR protocol | Contractual incident cooperation terms; treat external agents as untrusted peers |

